            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantifiers"} quantifiers
            is due to
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bill+Lawvere"}> Bill Lawvere
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Adjointness in Foundations
              = succeed ")," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.emis.de/journals/TAC/reprints/articles/16/tr16abs.html"} TAC
          %p and further developed in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bill+Lawvere"}> Bill Lawvere
              ,
              %em Equality in hyperdoctrines and
              %p comprehension schema as an adjoint functor_, Proceedings of the AMS Symposium on Pure Mathematics XVII (1970), 1-14.
          %p Exposition of the interpretation of substitution as pullback:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrej+Bauer"}> Andrej Bauer
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://math.andrej.com/2012/09/28/substitution-is-pullback/"} Substitution is pullback
          %p
